{
  "action": "After a standard system update you need to restart LXC containers to\nmake all the necessary changes.",
  "cves": [
    "CVE-2022-47952",
    "CVE-2026-39402"
  ],
  "description": "Maher Azzouzi discovered that LXC did not correctly handle logging\ncertain failure messages. An attacker could possibly use this issue\nto leak sensitive information. This issue only affected\nUbuntu 16.04 LTS, Ubuntu 18.04 LTS, Ubuntu 20.04 LTS,\nUbuntu 22.04 LTS and Ubuntu 24.04 LTS. (CVE-2022-47952)\n\nSam Sanoop discovered that LXC did not correctly handle certain forms\nof user authorization. An attacker could possibly use this issue to\ncause a denial of service. (CVE-2026-39402)",
  "id": "USN-8826-1",
  "isummary": "Several security issues were fixed in LXC.",
